sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Android 종료 보행 업로드
  participant G as Gateway
  participant L as Session walk consent ledger
  participant B as Backend
  A->>G: RAW manifest chunk 또는commit
  G->>L: 현재device generation endedwalk consent 확인
  G->>G: global raw write slot 1개획득
  G->>B: HEAD preflight 서명
  B-->>G: admission
  G->>L: write gate 재확인
  G->>A: body read
  A-->>G: 정확길이와digest body
  G->>L: write gate 재확인
  G->>B: PUT 또는POST 서명된정확bytes
  B-->>G: ack receipt
  G->>L: 응답전후 binding gate
  alt 여전히유효
    G-->>A: 검증한projection
  else stale
    G-->>A: 409 결과조정필요
  end
  G->>G: slot 및privacy lease 해제
